view.template:
{% load view_tags %}
{% get_set 'project/partner/id' as partners %}

<h1>Readme created with RDMO</h1>

<b>What is the title of the software project? (project/title):</b>

{% render_value_list 'project/title' %}

<b>Which research field(s) does this software belong to? (project/research_field):</b>

{% render_value_list 'project/research_field' %}

<b>What is the intended use of the software? How will your software contribute to research? (project/research_question/title):</b>

{% render_value_list 'project/research_question/title' %}

<b>Who are the project participants that deal with this software? (project/partner/id):</b>

<ul>
{% for p in partners %}
  {% get_set_value p 'project/partner/orcid-id' as p_orcid_id %}
  {% get_set_values p 'project/partner/affiliation' as p_affiliations %}
  <li>{{ p.value }}{% if p_orcid_id.value %} ({{ p_orcid_id.value }}){% endif %}{% if p_affiliations %}, {% for a in p_affiliations %}{% if a.external_id %}{{ a.external_id }} at {% endif %}{{ a.value }}{% if not forloop.last %} & {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}</li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>

<b>What licences are on the third-party software components? (smp/software-license):</b>

{% render_value_list 'smp/software-license' %}
